---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | NepalRanks"
  description="How NepalRanks handles data and privacy."
  noindex
>
  <article class="nr-prose py-16">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="nr-article mt-6">
      <p>This policy explains what information NepalRanks collects and how it is used.</p>
      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        We do not require accounts. We may collect anonymous, aggregated analytics such as
        page views and referrers to understand what content is useful.
      </p>
      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>Any cookies used are limited to analytics and are not used to identify you personally.</p>
      <h2>Third parties</h2>
      <p>
        Affiliate and retail links may set their own cookies once you leave our site. Their
        privacy policies apply on their domains.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:hello@nepalranks.com">hello@nepalranks.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
